              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngase ngithuma o-Eliyezeri, no-Ariyeli, noShemaya, no-Elinathani, noJaribi, no-Elinathani, noNathani, noZakariya, noMeshulamu, izinhloko; nakuJehoyaribi naku-Elinathani, amadoda ahlakaniphileyo.",
