          "text": "Ngabathuma ngomyalo ku-Ido, umbusi endaweni yaseKasifiya, ngabatshela lokho ababeyakukusho ku-Ido nakubafowabo, amaNethini, endaweni yaseKasifiya, ukuthi izinceku zabo zendlu yethu zaziyinkosi. Ukuletha ekhaya kithi. UNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
