              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngesandla esihle sikaNkulunkulu wethu esiphezu kwethu basilethela indoda ehlakaniphileyo emadodaneni kaMagi, indodana kaLevi, indodana ka-Israyeli; noSherebiya namadodana akhe nabafowabo, beyishumi nesishiyagalombili;",
          "type": "text",
