              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakubakhonzi basethempelini uDavide nezikhulu ababebamise enkonzweni yamaLevi, amaNethini angamakhulu amabili namashumi amabili; zonke ezishiwo ngamagama.",
