          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngase ngimemezela khona ngasemfuleni i-Ahawa usuku lokuzila ukudla, ukuze sizithobe phambi kukaNkulunkulu wethu, sizifunele kuye indlela eqondileyo thina nabantwana bethu nempahla yethu yonke.",
          "type": "text",
