          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba ngaba namahloni ukucela enkosini iviyo lamasosha nabamahhashi ukuba basisize ezitheni endleleni, ngokuba sakhuluma enkosini, sathi: Isandla sikaNkulunkulu wethu siphezu kwabo bonke abamfunayo; kepha amandla akhe nolaka lwakhe kuphezu kwabo bonke abamshiyayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
