          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabalinganisela isiliva negolide nezitsha, umnikelo wendlu kaNkulunkulu wethu inkosi, nabeluleki bayo, nezikhulu zayo, no-Israyeli wonke ababeyilethe khona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
