          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngathi kubo: “Ningcwele kuJehova; izinto nazo zingcwele; isiliva negolide kungumnikelo wesihle kuJehova uNkulunkulu wawoyihlo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.28",
